:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-history-project-intro'>>
  <<npc Winter>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Winter waits for the room to settle, then places a photograph
      of the painting you returned on the desk.
      <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
        The red moon looks dull on paper.
      <<else>>
        The snake-woman's carved frame casts a crooked shadow across the photograph.
      <</if>>
    <br><br>
    "The museum intends to build a local-history exhibition around this painting," <<he>> says.
      "The records attached to it are incomplete, while the stories are anything but."
    <br><br>
    <<He>> lays a blank catalogue card beside the photograph.
      "Establish what can be verified about the painting, its history and the scene it depicts.
      Mark everything else for what it is. A compelling story is not the same thing as evidence."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      温特等教室安静下来，随后把你交还的画作照片放在讲桌上。
      <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
        照片里的红月显得黯淡无光。
      <<else>>
        蛇女画框的雕纹在照片上投下一道歪斜的阴影。
      <</if>>
    <br><br>
    “博物馆准备以这幅画为中心，举办一场本地历史展览。”<<he>>说道，
      “与它有关的记录残缺不全，故事倒是多得很。”
    <br><br>
    <<He>>把一张空白的藏品卡放在照片旁。
      “查清这幅画的年代、流传经历，以及画中场景有哪些内容可以核实。
      其余部分要如实标明。一个故事再动听，也不等于证据。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<historyicon>><<link `lanSwitch('Take the project', '接下项目')` 'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Begin'>>
    <<set $phase to 0>>
  <</link>><<ghistory>><br>
  <<if
    C.npc.Robin.init is 1 and
    C.npc.Robin.dom gt 30 and
    C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 20 and
    ['active', 'seat'].includes($robinhistory)
  >>
    <<loveicon>><<link
      `lanSwitch('Ask Robin to work with you', '邀请罗宾协助')`
      'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Begin'
    >>
      <<set $phase to 1>>
    <</link>><<glove 'Robin'>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<link `lanSwitch('Not yet', '暂时不接')` 'History Lesson'>><<endevent>><</link>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-history-project-home-option'>>
  <<if
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.status is 'ongoing' and
    Time.days lt $VanillaPlus.historyProject.deadline
  >>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.draft is 0>>
      <<if
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.archive gt 0 and
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.museum gt 0
      >>
        <<historyicon>><<link
          `lanSwitch('Prepare the local-history exhibition (1:00)', '准备本地历史展览 (1:00)')`
          'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Draft'
        >><<pass 60>><</link>><br>
    <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-history-project-library-option'>>
  <<if
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.status is 'ongoing' and
    Time.days lt $VanillaPlus.historyProject.deadline and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.archive is 0
  >>
    <<historyicon>><<link
      `lanSwitch('Research the painting\'s history (1:00)', '调查画作的历史记录 (1:00)')`
      'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Archive'
    >><<pass 60>><</link>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-history-project-museum-options'>>
  <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.status is 'ongoing'>>
    <<if
      Time.days lt $VanillaPlus.historyProject.deadline and
      $VanillaPlus.historyProject.archive gt 0 and
      $VanillaPlus.historyProject.museum is 0
    >>
      <<museumicon>><<link
        `lanSwitch('Examine the returned painting (1:00)', '考证交还的画作 (1:00)')`
        'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Museum'
      >><<pass 60>><</link>><br>
  <<elseif Time.days gte $VanillaPlus.historyProject.deadline>>
      <<historyicon>><<link
        `lanSwitch('Present your local-history exhibition (2:00)', '进行本地历史展览 (2:00)')`
        'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Exhibition'
      >><<pass 2 hours>><</link>><br>
  <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-history-project-lake-option'>>
  <<if
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.status is 'ongoing' and
    Time.days lt $VanillaPlus.historyProject.deadline and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.archive gt 0 and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.museum gt 0 and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.ruin is 0 and
    !Weather.isFrozen('lake') and
    Time.hour gte 6 and
    Time.hour lte 18
  >>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      <<antiqueicon 'disc'>><<link
        `lanSwitch('Survey the lake ruin with Robin (2:00)', '与罗宾前往湖底废墟进行勘察 (2:00)')`
        'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Preparation'
      >><<pass 2 hours>><</link>><br>
    <<else>>
      <<antiqueicon 'disc'>><<link
        `lanSwitch('Survey the lake ruin (2:00)', '前往湖底废墟进行勘察 (2:00)')`
        'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Preparation'
      >><<pass 2 hours>><</link>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-history-project-kylar-street-event'>>
  <<if
    $bus is 'high' and
    $exposed lte 0 and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.status is 'ongoing' and
    Time.days lt $VanillaPlus.historyProject.deadline and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar isnot 'none' and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.archive gt 0 and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.museum gt 0 and
    !$VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarStreet and
    $VanillaPlus.historyProject.ruin is 0 and
    C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active'
  >>
    <<addinlineevent 'deadwoodRebloomsHistoryKylar' 1>>
      <<run statusCheck('Kylar')>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A familiar green hood vanishes behind a shop sign.
          When you stop, Kylar edges back into view, clutching a folded sheet.
          <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help'>>
            "I knew you'd notice me," <<he>> says, blushing.
              <<He>> offers you a pencil rubbing taken from an old foundation stone behind the temple.
              "You've been looking at old writing, so I looked too. I thought you might need me."
            <br><br>
            The ring of letters resembles the forms copied in your project notes.
              It is a clue, although Kylar's account of where it came from needs checking.
          <<else>>
            "Robin dropped these," <<he>> says, thrusting your project folder towards you.
              "I fixed the order. You shouldn't trust <<him>> with important things."
            <br><br>
            The copies are almost too neat.
              Several route arrows have been redrawn in darker pencil,
              and the page numbers are no longer in your handwriting.
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一顶熟悉的绿色兜帽消失在商店招牌后。
          你停下脚步后，凯拉尔才抱着一张折起的纸，小心地重新探出身来。
          <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help'>>
            “我就知道你会注意到我。”<<he>>红着脸说道。
              <<He>>递给你一张铅笔拓片，据说取自神殿后方一块古老的地基石。
              “你最近一直在看古老文字，所以我也去看了。我觉得你可能会需要我。”
            <br><br>
            环形文字与项目笔记里抄录的字形相似。
              这算得上一条线索，只是凯拉尔所说的来源仍需核实。
          <<else>>
            “罗宾把这些弄丢了。”<<he>>说道，把你的项目文件夹塞回你怀里，
              “我替你排好了顺序。重要的东西不能交给<<him>>。”
            <br><br>
            这些副本整齐得有些过头。
              几枚路线箭头被深色铅笔重新画过，页码也不再是你的笔迹。
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
      <br><br>
      <<historyicon>><<link
        `lanSwitch('Check the sheet against your numbered notes', '与编好页码的记录核对')`
        'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Kylar Check'
      >><</link>><<ghistory>><br>
      <<loveicon>><<link
        `lanSwitch('Take Kylar at their word', '相信凯拉尔的话')`
        'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Kylar Trust'
      >><</link>><br>
    <</addinlineevent>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-history-project-journal'>>
  <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.status is 'ongoing'>>
    <h1 class="header gold bold"><<lanSwitch 'Local History Exhibition' '本地历史展览'>></h1>
    <<set $_historyDays to Math.max(0, $VanillaPlus.historyProject.deadline - Time.days)>>
    <<if $_historyDays is 0>>
      <<lanSwitch 'The exhibition opens today.' '展览将在今天开始。'>>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch `The exhibition opens in ${$_historyDays} days.` `距离展览开始还有 ${$_historyDays} 天。`>>
    <</if>>
    <br>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Robin is helping you organise the project.' '罗宾正在协助你整理项目。'>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Historical records' '历史记录'>>:
      <<= $VanillaPlus.historyProject.archive > 0
        ? lanSwitch('complete', '已完成')
        : lanSwitch('incomplete', '未完成')
      >><br>
    <<lanSwitch 'Painting examination' '画作考证'>>:
      <<= $VanillaPlus.historyProject.museum > 0
        ? lanSwitch('complete', '已完成')
        : lanSwitch('incomplete', '未完成')
      >><br>
    <<lanSwitch 'Optional field trip' '可选实地调查'>>:
      <<= $VanillaPlus.historyProject.ruin > 0
        ? lanSwitch('complete', '已完成')
        : lanSwitch('not attempted', '尚未进行')
      >><br>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.ruin gt 0>>
      <<antiqueicon 'golden-priestess'>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Forest lake field notes recorded' '已记录森林湖实地笔记'>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Exhibition draft' '展览草稿'>>:
      <<= $VanillaPlus.historyProject.draft > 0
        ? lanSwitch('complete', '已完成')
        : lanSwitch('incomplete', '未完成')
      >><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-history-project-robin-vision'>>
  <<rng>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="purple">
        <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>
          <<if $rng lte 33>>
            Robin holds your gaze while purple halos gather around <<his>> face.
          <<elseif $rng lte 66>>
            <<His>> hand finds yours through a forest of phantom fingers.
          <<else>>
            "Still here," Robin says, grounding you both against the shifting stone.
          <</if>>
        <<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 10>>
          <<if $rng lte 33>>
            Robin flinches from a shadow, then relaxes when you touch <<his>> cheek.
          <<elseif $rng lte 66>>
            <<He>> whispers your name to separate you from the figures in the water.
          <<else>>
            The ruined chamber becomes a cage until Robin presses <<his>> forehead to yours.
          <</if>>
        <<else>>
          <<if $rng lte 33>>
            Droplets drift like stars between you and Robin.
          <<elseif $rng lte 66>>
            Robin laughs as the guide rope curls into a ribbon of golden light.
          <<else>>
            Your reflections lean together before either of you moves.
          <</if>>
        <</if>>
      </span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="purple">
        <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>
          <<if $rng lte 33>>
            紫色光晕聚在罗宾脸庞周围，<<he>>始终注视着你的双眼。
          <<elseif $rng lte 66>>
            <<His>>手穿过幻觉中层叠的手指，准确地握住了你。
          <<else>>
            “还在这里。”罗宾说道，借不断变形的石壁让你们保持清醒。
          <</if>>
        <<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 10>>
          <<if $rng lte 33>>
            罗宾被一道阴影惊得退缩，直到你触碰<<his>>脸颊才放松下来。
          <<elseif $rng lte 66>>
            <<He>>反复低声念着你的名字，把你与水中的人影区分开来。
          <<else>>
            废墟在眼中化作囚笼，直到罗宾把额头贴上你的额头。
          <</if>>
        <<else>>
          <<if $rng lte 33>>
            水珠如繁星般漂浮在你与罗宾之间。
          <<elseif $rng lte 66>>
            导向绳卷成一缕金色光带，惹得罗宾轻笑出声。
          <<else>>
            你们尚未动作，水中的倒影便已经依偎在一起。
          <</if>>
        <</if>>
      </span>
  <</language>>
  <br>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Begin []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'school'>><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<set $_historySource to $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source>>
<<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject to {
  status: 'ongoing',
  source: $_historySource,
  availableDay: 0,
  deadline: Time.days + 25,
  assistant: $phase is 1,
  kylar: $phase is 1 ? 'sabotage' : 'help',
  kylarStreet: false,
  kylarPrepared: false,
  archive: 0,
  museum: 0,
  recovery: 'none',
  ruin: 0,
  draft: 0,
  final: 0
}>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $phase is 1>>
      <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
      Robin looks up in surprise when you ask.
        "Me? Of course," <<he>> says, pulling <<his>> notebook closer.
        "I can keep the records in order while you work out what they mean."
      <br><br>
      <<npc Winter>><<person1>>
      Winter gives Robin a stern look. "Assistance is permitted. The argument remains your responsibility."
    <<else>>
      <<npc Winter>><<person1>>
      You take the catalogue card. Winter watches you slip it behind the photograph.
        "Good," <<he>> says. "Begin with the records.
        Establish when each claim first appeared before you decide what to believe."
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $phase is 1>>
      <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
      你开口邀请后，罗宾惊讶地抬起头。“我？当然可以。”<<he>>把笔记本拉到面前，
        “你来判断那些东西意味着什么，我可以帮你把资料整理好。”
      <br><br>
      <<npc Winter>><<person1>>
      温特严厉地看了罗宾一眼。“可以协助整理，但最终论证仍由你负责。”
    <<else>>
      <<npc Winter>><<person1>>
      你接过藏品卡，把它夹在照片后面。温特注视着你的动作。“很好。”<<he>>说道，
        “先从记录查起。先弄清每种说法最早在何时出现，再决定哪些内容值得相信。”
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink 'Continue the lesson' 'History Lesson'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Kylar Check []
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'town'>><<effects>><<run statusCheck('Kylar')>>
<<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarStreet to true>>
<<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarPrepared to true>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help'>>
      You compare Kylar's rubbing with the transcriptions in the museum catalogue.
        The letter forms are similar, but you mark the find as an unverified comparison
        until its origin can be checked.
        Kylar watches you add it to your folder, smiling as if <<he>> has been invited into the project.
      <br><br>
      "I can find more," <<he>> says. "I know everywhere you go."
    <<else>>
      Your numbered notes reveal two substituted pages.
        One shifts the lake approach away from the route shown in the old survey;
        the other removes Robin's initials. You restore the originals.
      <br><br>
      "Robin made mistakes," Kylar insists.
        <<His>> expression hardens when you refuse the altered pages.
        "I was helping." <<He>> snatches the copies back and disappears into the crowd.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help'>>
      你将凯拉尔的拓片与博物馆目录里的文字转录进行比对。
        字形确实相似，但在来源得到核实前，
        你仍把这条发现标为未经核实的旁证。
        凯拉尔看着你把拓片收进文件夹，笑得仿佛<<he>>也受邀加入了项目。
      <br><br>
      “我还能找到更多。”<<he>>说道，“你去过的每个地方，我都知道。”
    <<else>>
      编好页码的记录暴露出两张被替换的纸。
        其中一张把湖边路线移离旧测绘图标出的方向，
        另一张则抹去了罗宾的姓名缩写。你把原件重新放回去。
      <br><br>
      “罗宾弄错了。”凯拉尔坚持道。
        你拒绝使用修改后的纸张，<<his>>表情顿时阴沉下来。
        “我是在帮忙。”<<He>>抢回那些副本，消失在人群里。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help'>>
  <<npcincr Kylar love 2>><<gglove 'Kylar'>>
<<else>>
  <<npcincr Kylar rage 2>><<ggksuspicion>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<highicon>><<lanLink 'Continue along High Street' 'High Street'>>
  <<endevent>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Kylar Trust []
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'town'>><<effects>><<run statusCheck('Kylar')>>
<<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarStreet to true>>
<<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarPrepared to
  $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help'
>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help'>>
      You accept the rubbing. Kylar presses it into your hands, then folds your fingers over it.
        "You don't need Robin," <<he>> murmurs.
        "You can always ask me. Even if you don't see me."
      <br><br>
      The copied letters may help you recognise religious markings, although the source still needs checking.
    <<else>>
      You replace your folder with Kylar's tidier copy.
        <<He>> hugs it to <<his>> chest for a moment before surrendering it.
        "Now it only has what you need," <<he>> says, glancing past you for Robin.
      <br><br>
      You do not notice that one approach arrow has been reversed.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help'>>
      你接过拓片。凯拉尔把它按进你手里，又合拢你的手指。
        “你不需要罗宾。”<<he>>低声说道，
        “随时都可以找我。哪怕你看不见我。”
      <br><br>
      抄下的文字或许能帮你辨认宗教标记，只是来源仍需核实。
    <<else>>
      你用凯拉尔整理得更整齐的副本替换了文件夹。
        <<He>>先把它抱在胸前片刻，才终于交给你。
        “现在里面只剩下你需要的东西了。”<<he>>说道，
        同时越过你望向街道，寻找罗宾的身影。
      <br><br>
      你没有发现，其中一枚路线箭头被画反了。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove 'Kylar'>>
<br><br>
<<highicon>><<lanLink 'Continue along High Street' 'High Street'>>
  <<endevent>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Archive []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'school'>><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
  <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
      You spread wartime notices,
      newspaper cuttings and later accounts of the red-moon painting across a library table.
      Separate records confirm the night raid, damage to the town and the delayed evacuation.
      The first claim that the painting predicted later red moons appears much more recently.
    <<else>>
      You spread old catalogue entries, copies of the translated frame inscription
      and several versions of the snake-woman's story across a library table.
      The catalogues agree that the painting is centuries old.
      The stories agree on little beyond a persecuted wise woman, a gaoler and the temple's hostility.
    <</if>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      Robin sorts the accounts by date and copies each citation onto a separate slip.
        "These three all repeat the same book," <<he>> says.
        "They look like different sources, but they aren't."
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
      你把战时通告、旧报纸剪页
      和后世关于红月画作的记载摊在图书馆桌上。
      彼此独立的记录可以证实夜间空袭、城镇受损，以及疏散行动的延误。
      声称画作预言了后来红月的文字，却直到很晚才第一次出现。
    <<else>>
      你把旧目录条目、画框题名的译文副本，
      以及数种蛇女故事摊在图书馆桌上。
      目录一致认为画作已有数百年历史。
      至于遭受迫害的智者、狱卒与神殿的敌意，各版故事除此之外几乎没有共识。
    <</if>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      罗宾按年代整理记载，又把每条引文分别抄到纸条上。
        “这三份其实都在转述同一本书，”<<he>>说道，
        “看起来像不同来源，其实不是。”
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
  <<historyicon>><<link
    `lanSwitch('Trace each claim back to its earliest source', '追查每项说法最早的出处')`
    'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Archive Finish'
  >><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<ghistory>><br>
<</if>>
<<historyicon>><<link
  `lanSwitch('Use the museum catalogue as your main source', '以博物馆目录为主要依据')`
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Archive Finish'
>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><br>
<<crimeicon 'documents'>><<link
  `lanSwitch('Combine the accounts into a cleaner story', '把不同记载拼成更顺畅的故事')`
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Archive Finish'
>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Archive Finish []
<<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject.archive to $phase is 0 ? 30 : 18>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $phase is 0>>
      You reduce the apparent pile of sources to a few independent accounts.
      <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
        The raid and its aftermath
        are documented history. The prediction and later red-moon effects belong to the painting's reputation.
      <<else>>
        The catalogues establish the painting's age and titles.
        The changing tale records how people interpreted it, not what literally happened.
      <</if>>
      <span class="green">Your written record distinguishes evidence from repetition.</span>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
      You copy the museum catalogue.
      Its summary is useful, but several confident statements lack a cited source.
      <span class="teal">You have a usable source record.</span>
    <<else>>
      You smooth away the contradictions and turn several versions into one convincing narrative.
      It reads well, but some of its certainty comes from your own wording.
      <span class="teal">You have a usable source record.</span><<delinquency 10>><<gdelinquency>>
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $phase is 0>>
      你把看似庞杂的资料还原成少数几份彼此独立的记载。
      <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
        空袭及其后果属于有记录的历史。
        所谓预言与后来红月造成的影响，则属于画作逐渐形成的名声。
      <<else>>
        目录可以证实画作的年代与题名。
        不断变化的故事记录的是后人的理解，而非事件原貌。
      <</if>>
      <span class="green">你的文献记录清楚区分了证据与重复转述。</span>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
      你抄下博物馆目录的概要。
      内容足够使用，其中几句笃定的判断却没有注明出处。
      <span class="teal">你整理出了一份可用的史料记录。</span>
    <<else>>
      你抹平彼此矛盾的部分，把不同版本拼成了一条颇具说服力的叙述。
      文章读起来很顺畅，只是其中一部分确定语气来自你自己的改写。
      <span class="teal">你整理出了一份可用的史料记录。</span><<delinquency 10>><<gdelinquency>>
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<schoolicon 'library'>><<link `lanSwitch('Return to the library', '返回图书馆')` 'School Library'>><</link>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Museum []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'museum'>><<effects>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
  <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Your project permit gives you access to a study table in the museum store.
    The returned painting rests beneath a conservation lamp beside its frame,
    old catalogue cards and a folder of condition reports.
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
      The red paint deepens when the lamp dims,
      then becomes pale and watery beneath direct light. The canvas is unsigned.
    <<else>>
      The translated title remains on the back of the carved frame.
      Burns, water damage and a silver-lined cut scar the canvas.
    <</if>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      Robin arranges the cards by date, careful not to lean across the painting.
        "This description was copied from a later one," <<he>> says.
        "They changed a few words, but not the mistake."
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    项目许可让你得以使用博物馆库房里的研究桌。
    交还的画作被放在修复灯下，旁边摆着原画框、旧目录卡和一册状况记录。
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
      灯光变暗时，红色颜料随之浓郁；
      直射光下，它又变得苍白而水润。画布上没有署名。
    <<else>>
      雕花画框背面仍保留着题名的原文。
      火烧、水浸，以及一道残留银屑的割痕共同留在画布上。
    <</if>>
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      罗宾按日期排好卡片，小心地避开画作。
        “这段说明抄自更晚的一份。”<<he>>说道，
        “他们改了几个词，连错误也一起抄了下来。”
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
  <<historyicon>><<link
    `lanSwitch('Match each claim to the object and its records', '将每项说法与画作及记录逐一核对')`
    'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Museum Finish'
  >><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<ghistory>><br>
<</if>>
<<museumicon>><<link
  `lanSwitch('Trust the most detailed catalogue card', '相信内容最详细的目录卡')`
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Museum Finish'
>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><br>
<<if hasSexStat('exhibitionism', 2)>>
  <<icon 'clothes/tuxedo-jacket.png'>><<link
    `lanSwitch('Try on the proposed display costume', '试穿拟用于展览的复原服装')`
    'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Museum Finish'
  >><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<exhibitionist2>><br>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Museum Finish []
<<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject.museum to $phase is 0 ? 30 : 18>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
  <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $phase is 0>>
      <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
        The stored frame fits the canvas,
        and the changing pigment is plainly real. Neither identifies the artist nor proves a prediction.
      <<else>>
        The frame inscription and physical wear support the painting's age.
        The silver in the cut is damage, not proof of any version of the tale.
      <</if>>
      <span class="green">You separate the painting from the claims attached to it.</span>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
      You copy the most detailed card.
      Its confident wording hides how much was added after the painting entered the collection.
      <span class="teal">Your object notes are usable, though some claims remain weak.</span>
    <<else>>
      The proposed costume is an unfinished reconstruction held together with pins and narrow ties.
      You remove your outer clothes before stepping into it.
      <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
        Robin holds a folding screen around you and compares each loose panel with the painted figure.
        When a curator approaches, <<he>> abandons the notes and presses the screen closed,
        trapping <<himself>> inside with you. "It still needs work," <<he>> whispers, bright red.
      <<else>>
        You compare the loose drapery with the painted figure in the reflection of the conservation glass.
        Anyone entering the store would receive a much clearer view than the future display intended.
      <</if>>
      The attempt exposes how much of the costume exists only in the curator's interpretation.
      <span class="teal">Your demonstration is memorable, though it adds little to the provenance.</span>
      <<exhibitionism1>><<stress 6>><<gstress>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    A misfiled inventory sketch falls from the back of the folder.
      It shows a missing golden priestess statuette.
      A pencilled note refers only to an old survey of the forest lake.
      The lead has no clear connection to your painting, but it may be worth following.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $phase is 0>>
      <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.source is 'paintingward'>>
        库藏画框与画布完全吻合，
        颜料随光线变化的现象也确实存在。
        两者都不能说明画家是谁，更无法证明任何预言。
      <<else>>
        画框题名与实物磨损能够支持画作的年代判断。
        割痕里的银屑只是损伤，不能证明任何一个故事版本。
      <</if>>
      <span class="green">你把画作本身与后来附会的说法区分开来。</span>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
      你抄下内容最详细的目录卡。
      笃定的语气掩盖了一个事实：其中不少说法都是画作入藏后才添上的。
      <span class="teal">你的实物记录可以使用，只是部分说法依据薄弱。</span>
    <<else>>
      拟用于展览的复原服装尚未完工，只靠别针和细带固定。
      你脱去外衣，随后钻了进去。
      <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
        罗宾把折叠屏风围在你身边，对照画中人物检查每一片松散的布料。
        馆员的脚步声接近时，<<he>>扔下笔记，匆忙合拢屏风，
        结果把<<himself>>也关在了里面。“还得再改改。”<<he>>满脸通红地低声说道。
      <<else>>
        你借修复玻璃的倒影，把松散垂下的布料与画中人物逐一比较。
        若有人走进库房，看到的内容会比未来展览原本打算呈现的清楚得多。
      <</if>>
      这次试穿只证明，服装的大部分细节都来自馆员的解释，而不是画面本身。
      <span class="teal">你的演示令人难忘，对画作来历却帮助不大。</span>
      <<exhibitionism1>><<stress 6>><<gstress>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    一张放错位置的藏品草图从文件夹背面滑落。
      图上画着一尊失踪的金制女祭司像，铅笔批注却只提到一次早年的森林湖勘察。
      这条线索与画作没有明确关系，但或许值得顺路查一查。
<</language>>
<br><br><<museumicon>><<lanLink 'Return to the museum' 'Museum'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Preparation []
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'lake'>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
  <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    At the lake shore, you spread your copied bearings across a dry rock.
    You mark the planned route on a slate, knot the guide rope at measured intervals
    and fasten a padded recovery pouch to your diving suit.
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      Robin copies the route onto a second slate while you test both tethers.
        "I'm not a great swimmer," <<person1>><<he>> admits,
        fastening <<his>> line beside yours, "but I'm not letting you go down there alone."
    <<else>>
      You drive the shore anchor between two rocks and pull against it with your full weight.
        The rope holds. From here on, every mark will have to be made by you.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你在湖岸找了块干燥的岩石，将抄录的方位数据摊在上面。
    你把预定路线画在记录板上，按固定间距给导向绳打结，
    又将内衬软垫的回收袋系在潜水服外。
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      你测试两根安全绳时，罗宾把路线誊写到第二块记录板上。
        “我不太会游泳，”<<person1>><<he>>承认道，
        同时把<<his>>绳索扣在你的绳索旁，“但我不会让你独自下去。”
    <<else>>
      你把岸边的固定钉砸进两块岩石之间，又用全身重量拉扯几次。
        绳索纹丝不动。从现在起，每一项记录都只能由你自己完成。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<getinicon>><<link
  `lanSwitch('Enter the water', '进入湖水')`
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Descent'
>><</link>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Descent []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
  <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You descend beside the guide rope.
    Blocks of worked stone emerge from the silt.
    Weathered figures with six arms repeat along the walls,
    interrupted by a sealed doorway ringed with unfamiliar runes.
    Purple lichen glows between the stones like veins beneath skin.
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      Robin keeps one hand locked around the rope and the other around your wrist.
        Each time the current turns <<him>> sideways, <<he>> looks to you before continuing.
      <<if
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'sabotage' and
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarStreet and
        !$VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarPrepared
      >>
        At the first marker, Robin notices that the route arrow in your folder points the wrong way.
          <<He>> corrects it against <<his>> numbered copy,
          but the detour costs time and stirs silt across the entrance.
      <</if>>
    <<else>>
      The guide rope is anchored at the entrance.
        Its evenly spaced knots are the only straight thing in the wavering dark.
      <<if
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help' and
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarStreet
      >>
        The letter forms on Kylar's rubbing help you recognise the religious markings around a side alcove.
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    In a collapsed alcove, your lamp catches a golden figure beneath a fallen tile.
      The tiny priestess kneels above a base ringed with archaic script.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你沿着导向绳下潜。经过切削的石块逐渐从淤泥中显现。
    墙面上反复出现风化的六臂人像，一道封死的门扉打断了它们，
    门边还环绕着你无法辨认的符文。
    紫色地衣在石缝间发光，仿佛皮肤下的血管。
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      罗宾一只手紧抓导向绳，另一只手握住你的手腕。
        每次水流把<<him>>冲得偏转，<<he>>都会先看向你，再继续前进。
      <<if
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'sabotage' and
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarStreet and
        !$VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarPrepared
      >>
        到达第一处标记时，罗宾发现文件夹里的路线箭头指向了错误方向。
          <<He>>对照<<his>>编好页码的副本修正路线，绕路却耗费了时间，
          还搅起淤泥，遮住了入口。
    <</if>>
    <<else>>
      导向绳固定在入口处。
        水波令一切扭曲不定，只有间距一致的绳结仍维持着笔直的方向。
      <<if
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylar is 'help' and
        $VanillaPlus.historyProject.kylarStreet
      >>
        凯拉尔拓片上的字形帮助你认出了侧面壁龛周围的宗教标记。
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    在一处坍塌的壁龛里，你的灯照见石片下的一点金光。
      小巧的女祭司像跪在底座上，周围环绕着一圈古文字。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<historyicon>><<link
  `lanSwitch('Record its position before lifting the tile', '先记录位置，再抬起石片')`
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Statuette'
>><<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject.recovery to 'recorded'>><</link>><<ghistory>><br>
<<antiqueicon 'golden-priestess'>><<link
  `lanSwitch('Pull the statuette free before the silt buries it', '赶在淤泥掩埋前取出女祭司像')`
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Statuette'
>><<set $VanillaPlus.historyProject.recovery to 'rushed'>><</link>><<stress 6>><<gstress>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Statuette []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $museumAntiques.antiques.antiquegoldpriestess is 'notFound'>>
  <<set $antiquemoney += 4000>>
  <<museumAntiqueStatus 'antiquegoldpriestess' 'found'>>
<</if>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
  <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The tile shifts.
    You free a palm-sized golden statuette, its robed priestess kneeling with empty hands raised.
    Several letters around its base repeat forms copied in the temple records and museum catalogue.
    <span class="gold">You recover the golden priestess statuette.</span>
    <br><br>
    A cloud of purple spores blooms from the hollow and crawls through the edge of your mask.
    The broken wall stretches into a vast stone chamber.
    Cages line its edges. Shackles gleam inside them.
    A pale figure watches from beyond the bars while your tether becomes a golden chain around your ankles.
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      Robin catches you as you recoil.
        <<person1>><<His>> frightened face stays real while the pale figure draws closer.
        <<He>> presses your hand to the knots in the guide rope, trying to make you count them.
    <<else>>
      You pull the safety line. For several heartbeats it feels like a jailer pulling back.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    石片发生松动。你从下面取出一尊手掌大小的金像。
    身着长袍的女祭司跪在底座上，空着的双手向前托起。
    底座周围的几个字母，重复了神殿记录与博物馆目录里的字形。
    <span class="gold">你寻回了金制女祭司像。</span>
    <br><br>
    一团紫色孢子从空腔里绽开，钻过面镜边缘。
    断墙向两侧延伸，化作一间巨大的石室。
    囚笼沿墙排列，里面的镣铐反射着紫光。
    一道苍白的身影隔着栏杆注视着你，导向绳也化作了锁在脚踝上的金制镣铐。
    <<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
      你后退时，罗宾一把接住了你。苍白身影不断逼近，
        只有<<person1>><<his>>惊恐的面孔仍然真实。
        <<He>>把你的手按在导向绳的绳结上，试图让你数清它们。
    <<else>>
      你拉动安全绳。连续几个心跳间，绳子另一端都像是某个狱卒在向后拖拽。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<hallucinogen 120>><<gghallucinogens>>
<br><br>
<<if $VanillaPlus.historyProject.assistant>>
  <<loveicon>><<link
    `lanSwitch('Trust Robin and follow the original knots', '相信罗宾，沿原本的绳结前进')`
    'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Robin'
  >><</link>><<glove 'Robin'>><br>
  <<if $robinromance is 1>>
    <<getinicon>><<link
      `lanSwitch('Pull Robin into the air pocket', '把罗宾拉进气穴')`
      'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Robin Hallucination'
    >><</link>><<promiscuous1>><br>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<historyicon>><<link
    `lanSwitch('Count the knots and pull yourself towards the surface', '数清绳结，沿安全绳返回水面')`
    'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Solo'
  >><<willpower 1>><</link>><<gwillpower>><br>
  <<getinicon>><<link
    `lanSwitch('Force your way through the phantom prison', '强行穿过幻象中的囚室')`
    'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Solo'
  >><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<trauma 12>><<ggtrauma>><br>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Robin []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You close your hand over Robin's and count. One knot. Two. Three.
    The golden chain softens into rope beneath your fingers.
    When the pale figure reaches for you,
    Robin puts <<himself>> between you and the vision despite the terror in <<his>> eyes.
    <br><br>
    At the next marker, you turn together.
    The spectral doorway folds back into a collapsed wall.
    Robin does not release you until the water above turns pale.
    "I was scared," <<he>> admits. "But I knew I couldn't leave you there."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你握住罗宾的手，开始数数。一个绳结，两个，三个。
    锁在脚踝上的金链逐渐变回安全绳。苍白身影伸手抓来时，罗宾明明
    满眼恐惧，却仍把<<himself>>挡在你与幻象之间。
    <br><br>
    到达下一处标记后，你们一同转向。幽灵般的门洞重新坍缩成残墙。
    直到上方湖水渐渐透出亮色，罗宾才放开你。“我很害怕，”<<he>>承认道，
    “但我知道不能把你留在那里。”
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin love 2>><<gglove 'Robin'>><<stress -12>><<llstress>>
<br><br>
<<swimicon 'up'>><<lanLink
  'Return to the shore'
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Return'
>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Robin Hallucination []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<run statusCheck('Robin')>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Robin's breathing turns ragged. You pull <<him>> into the air pocket
    above the ruined chamber. You tear off your masks together.
    Purple dust clings to both wet seals, and the stone ceiling rolls like a dark tide.
    <br><br>
    Robin splits into three wavering figures before your eyes.
      <<He>> stares past your shoulder, then touches your cheek.
      "There are two of you," <<he>> says with a breathless laugh. "This one feels real."
      Your skin burns beneath <<his>> fingers. <<His>> pupils are as wide as yours.
    <<if $awareness gte 200>>
      The spores carry a hallucinogen and something powerfully arousing.
      <span class="red">Both of you breathed them in.</span>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>
      Robin catches both your hands and holds them still.
      "We should leave," <<he>> says, although <<he>> makes no move towards the water.
      <<He>> searches your face. "Tell me if you want me to stop."
    <<else>>
      "You are real, aren't you?" Robin asks. You press <<his>> palm over your heartbeat.
      <<He>> exhales and rests <<his>> forehead against yours. "Then don't disappear."
    <</if>>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 10>>
      A cage closes around the edge of Robin's vision.
      You say <<his>> name, and <<he>> focuses on you until its bars dissolve.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    You kiss. The ruined chamber blooms into purple light behind your closed eyes.
      Robin's hands tremble against you, but each touch is answered by one of your own.
      The guide rope remains looped around both your wrists, the last solid line in the shifting room.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    罗宾的呼吸变得急促。你把<<him>>拉进废弃石室上方的气穴，
    与<<him>>一同扯下面镜。两只潮湿的密封圈都沾着紫色粉末，
    石质穹顶则如漆黑的潮水般不断翻滚。
    <br><br>
    罗宾在你眼中分裂成三道摇晃的人影。
      <<He>>越过你的肩膀望了一眼，随后触碰你的脸颊。
      “我看见了两个你。”<<he>>气息凌乱地笑道，“这个摸起来是真的。”
      <<His>>指尖下，你的皮肤滚烫。<<His>>瞳孔也像你一样扩散开来。
    <<if $awareness gte 200>>
      孢子中既有致幻成分，也有某种强烈的催情成分。
      <span class="red">你们两人都吸进去了。</span>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>
      罗宾握住你的双手，让它们暂时安定下来。
      “我们应该离开。”<<he>>说道，却丝毫没有靠近水面的意思。
      <<He>>仔细观察你的表情。“如果你想让我停下，就告诉我。”
    <<else>>
      “你是真的，对吧？”罗宾问道。你把<<his>>手掌按在自己的心口。
      <<He>>呼出一口气，将额头贴上你的额头。“那就别消失。”
    <</if>>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 10>>
      一座囚笼在罗宾的视野边缘合拢。
      你唤出<<his>>名字，<<he>>专注地望着你，直到栏杆逐渐消散。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    你们吻在一起。闭上双眼后，整座废弃石室都绽放出紫色光芒。
      罗宾贴在你身上的双手仍在颤抖，你却用自己的触碰回应<<him>>的每一下动作。
      导向绳仍缠在你们的手腕上，是这间不断变形的石室中最后一条坚实的线。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<loveicon>><<link
  `lanSwitch('Pull Robin closer', '把罗宾拉得更近')`
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Robin Sex'
>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<glove 'Robin'>><br>
<<swimicon 'up'>><<link
  `lanSwitch('Break the kiss and follow the guide rope', '结束亲吻，沿导向绳离开')`
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Robin'
>><</link>><br>

