:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Robin Sex Finish []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<run statusCheck('Robin')>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
  <<ejaculation>><<npcincr Robin lust -20>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $enemyanger gte 20 or $consensual isnot 1>>
      Robin pulls away.
      The purple glow around <<him>> hardens into bars before fading back into dripping stone.
      "We should go," <<he>> says, reaching for the guide rope.
    <<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
      Robin winces and sinks back against the stone.
      The doubled image of <<his>> body slowly joins together as you help <<him>> sit upright.
    <<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
      Robin shudders and clings to you.
      A dozen phantom heartbeats collapse into the single rapid pulse beneath <<his>> skin.
    <<else>>
      You stop together, still tangled in each other's arms.
      Purple stars drift across Robin's flushed face whenever you blink.
    <</if>>
    <<if $enemyanger lt 20 and $consensual is 1>>
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>
        Robin cups your cheek and waits until your eyes focus on <<him>>.
        "Still want me here?" <<he>> asks. You nod, and <<he>> kisses your forehead.
      <<else>>
        Robin searches your face. "That was us, wasn't it? Not just the spores?"
        You squeeze <<his>> hand, and <<he>> answers with a shy, relieved smile.
      <</if>>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 10>>
        <br><br>
        A last phantom cage flickers behind Robin. <<He>> counts the knots aloud with you until it vanishes.
      <</if>>
      <<if $penisfucked is 1>>
        <br><br>"I can still feel you inside me," Robin admits, blushing.
      <<elseif $vaginafucked is 1>>
        <br><br>"I can still feel myself inside you," Robin admits, blushing.
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $enemyanger gte 20 or $consensual isnot 1>>
      罗宾向后退开。
      <<His>>周围的紫色光芒凝成栏杆，随后重新变回不断滴水的石壁。
      “我们该走了。”<<he>>说道，同时伸手抓住导向绳。
    <<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
      罗宾吃痛地靠回石壁。
      你扶<<him>>坐稳时，重叠的数道人影才逐渐合为一体。
    <<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
      罗宾浑身颤抖，紧紧依偎着你。
      幻觉中十几道凌乱的心跳，重新收束为<<his>>皮肤下急促的一次次搏动。
    <<else>>
      你们一同停下，手脚仍亲密地纠缠在一起。
      每当你眨眼，紫色星光便会从罗宾涨红的脸上飘过。
    <</if>>
    <<if $enemyanger lt 20 and $consensual is 1>>
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>
        罗宾捧住你的脸，等待你的视线重新聚焦在<<him>>身上。
        “还想让我留在这里吗？”<<he>>问道。你点点头，<<he>>便吻了吻你的额头。
      <<else>>
        罗宾观察着你的表情。“刚才是我们自己的想法，对吧？不全是孢子的作用？”
        你握紧<<his>>手，<<he>>则露出羞涩而安心的笑容。
      <</if>>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 10>>
        <br><br>
        最后一座幻象中的囚笼在罗宾身后闪烁。<<He>>与你一同数出绳结，直到它彻底消失。
      <</if>>
      <<if $penisfucked is 1>>
        <br><br>“我还能感觉到你在我里面。”罗宾红着脸承认道。
      <<elseif $vaginafucked is 1>>
        <br><br>“我还能感觉到自己在你里面。”罗宾红着脸承认道。
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<if $enemyanger lt 20 and $consensual is 1>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 2>><<gglove 'Robin'>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<endcombat>>
<<clotheson>>
<<swimicon 'up'>><<lanLink
  'Return to the shore'
  'Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Return'
>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms History Project Lake Solo []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'lake_ruin'>><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You force your attention onto the rope.
    The phantom chain bites into your palms, then softens one knot at a time.
    You pull until the ruined wall becomes stone again, then follow the knots towards the surface.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你迫使自己专注于绳索。
    幻象中的铁链割痛手掌，又随着一个个绳结逐渐变回柔软的绳子。
    你不断拉动绳索，直到坍塌的墙壁重新变回石头，随后沿着绳结返回水面。
<</language>>
<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
